I rather like the lowest level ones in each school, though the ones that
take more experience and energy can be nice.  So I'll sort them by an
order that includes phase of game.

Attack - force bolt, magic missile, finger of death.  Cold and fire have
side effects that are useful in non-combat situations.

Healing - healing, extra healing.

Divination - detect monsters or light, identify

Enchantment - sleep, charm monster

Clerical - create monster (rules in sacrifests), remove curse

Escape - jumping, teleport away

Matter - alternate knock and wizard lock to exercise the skill, dig and
polymorph


